    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A superb opportunity to acquire a spacious corner site ideally located just 2km from Ballybofey.\n\nMeasuring approximately 0.30 hectares (0.74 acres), this level site offers excellent development potential and is ready to go with full planning permission granted in April 2025 for a beautifully designed dwelling extending to 194.28 sq. m.\n\nNestled in a sought-after area, the site is just 500m from Glencovitt National School, with B&S Tennis Club and Ballybofey United FC grounds only 1km away. Less than a 5-minute drive to Ballybofey town centre, residents will enjoy the perfect balance of convenience and tranquility.\n\nThis is an exceptional opportunity to build your dream home in a peaceful yet well-connected setting."
      },
